{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2013a.q14.material.recovered", "text": "离园时，三岁的小凯对妈妈兴奋地说：“妈妈，今天我得了一个‘小笑脸’，老师还把它贴在我脑门儿上了。”妈妈听了很高兴，连续两天小凯都这样告诉妈妈。后来妈妈和老师沟通后才得知，小凯并没有得到“小笑脸”。妈妈生气地责怪小凯：“你这么小，怎么就说谎呢。”", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1f16a5ddb4f5c50b73d90a9ba64ee5a4f9b435cea12c05fbe58826f87eb5ab21", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 845, "decoded_csv_character_end": 967, "next_source_question_number": 14, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 14, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "1f16a5ddb4f5c50b73d90a9ba64ee5a4f9b435cea12c05fbe58826f87eb5ab21"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2013a.q14"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m2.k2", "ntce.youer.baojiao.m3.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.care", "ntce.youer.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.102.r001", "ntce.outline.102.r006"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2013a.q14"], "word_count": 122, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1f16a5ddb4f5c50b73d90a9ba64ee5a4f9b435cea12c05fbe58826f87eb5ab21", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 845, "decoded_csv_character_end": 967, "next_source_question_number": 14, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 14, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "1f16a5ddb4f5c50b73d90a9ba64ee5a4f9b435cea12c05fbe58826f87eb5ab2