{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2013a.q16.material.recovered", "text": "小班赵老师发现幼儿进餐时存在各种问题：有的幼儿情绪不稳定，吃饭时哭着要妈妈；有的幼儿不会自己吃，一定要老师喂；有的幼儿挑食，不吃这个，不吃那个；还有的幼儿吃一会，玩一会，饭凉了都还没吃完……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1f16a5ddb4f5c50b73d90a9ba64ee5a4f9b435cea12c05fbe58826f87eb5ab21", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1063, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1158, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 16, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "1f16a5ddb4f5c50b73d90a9ba64ee5a4f9b435cea12c05fbe58826f87eb5ab21"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2013a.q16"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m6.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.design"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.102.r001", "ntce.outline.102.r006", "ntce.outline.102.r007"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2013a.q16"], "word_count": 95, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1f16a5ddb4f5c50b73d90a9ba64ee5a4f9b435cea12c05fbe58826f87eb5ab21", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1063, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1158, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 16, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "1f16a5ddb4f5c50b73d90a9ba64ee5a4f9b435cea12c05fbe58826f87eb5ab21"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorizatio